        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best time to buy a generator is when you do not need one yet. Late fall through early spring gives you the best mix of promotions, stock and installer availability, and Black Friday on November 27 is the sale worth watching this year. Storm week is the one window to avoid at almost any price.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Whatever the calendar says, a deal only counts if it is the right machine. Size your loads, compare running watts and watt-hours, match the exact model number and check the 90-day price history. Then set it up, test it and connect it safely while the weather is still calm.
          </p>
        </div>

